  ["One a week...one a week...one a...", [["dave", "Feb 7, 2006", "Yes, so you’ve all been routing for us to do one episode a week. We really appreciate all of your support in pushing us to do: one a week, one a week, one a week...\nUnfortunately, with Heather and Sam in Arizona this weekend, and me in New York...well...we’re going to be running a little late.\nWe’ll shoot for mid-week next week to fill you in with all of the juicy gossip from our travels.\nMy brother will be here house sitting - no wild parties!\nCheers kids!\nDave, Heather and Sam."], ["im the mommy thats why", "Oct 5, 2006", "you’ll be lucky to get one in one a month as the kids get older! Or at least I would be! But I know I would love to hear you guys once a week!"], ["dave", "Oct 5, 2006", "Thanks. We’ll do our best to keep it up. We may have to start shooting for a bit of a shorter show going forward, but we’ll just have to see how things go...\nDon’t forget to subscribe, so you’ll get automatic updates when new episodes are available.\nYou can do this by using our iTunes button on the main page, or by entering your email address on the main page for automated updates.\nCheers!\nDave"]]]
